// W7-06 U3a/t, S-110, S-1177 (§11.5: "状態を持つものを枝に含まなければ E0812（修正候補は `~` を外すこと）"; §2.6: "状態を持つものを枝に含まない `if~` / `match~` の
// E0812 は、`~` を外す修正候補を示す"): a `match~` whose arms are values. The one error has the one candidate, the removal of the `~`, and the file with it checks
// clean (`clean` is about the whole file, so the file has this one error and no other unit with a candidate). The main position (`at`) is the `~` (S-392, provisional). One error per flow (P-01).

pub flow value_only(k: U32 at sample) -> F32 at sample {
  match~ k { 0 => 1.0, _ => 2.0 } //~ E0812
}
